{
  "total_duration": 847.256,
  "lines": [
    {
      "i": 0,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.24,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "现在的赛车很快、很稳、很科技。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 1,
      "start": 3.59,
      "end": 9.166,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "但这篇课文讲的是"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "old cars"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "重新上路参加比赛。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "start": 9.516,
      "end": 14.956,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "它们不一定快，还会砰砰响、半路坏掉，司机可能要钻到车底下修。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "start": 15.305,
      "end": 21.961,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "所以标题"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Faster than sound!"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "不是科学事实，而是一个好玩的夸张。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "start": 22.311,
      "end": 29.335,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "今天先记住这条线："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "old machines, loud noise, breakdowns, but real excitement"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "start": 29.685,
      "end": 32.645,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第一段，先看这场比赛为什么特别。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "start": 32.995,
      "end": 40.595,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：每年都会为旧车举行一次比赛；去年很多车参加，比赛开始前大家非常兴奋。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "start": 40.945,
      "end": 45.809,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "开头说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Once a year, a race is held for old cars"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "start": 46.158,
      "end": 53.094,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "A race is held"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是被动语态，重点是“有这样一场比赛”，不是谁组织它。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "start": 53.444,
      "end": 58.028,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "接着是："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "A lot of cars entered for this race last year"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "start": 58.378,
      "end": 63.842,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Entered for this race"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "不是走进房间，而是报名参加比赛。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "start": 64.192,
      "end": 69.76,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "开赛前的气氛很足："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "there was a great deal of excitement just before it began"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 12,
      "start": 70.11,
      "end": 80.261,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "A lot of cars"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "加上"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "a great deal of excitement"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，让我们先看到：旧车比赛虽然慢，但场面很热闹。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 13,
      "start": 80.611,
      "end": 87.051,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "所以第一帧先记中文：每年旧车赛，去年很多车参加，开赛前大家很兴奋。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 14,
      "start": 87.401,
      "end": 91.361,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第二段，看两辆最有记忆点的老车。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 15,
      "start": 91.711,
      "end": 104.511,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：最漂亮的车之一是 Rolls-Royce Silver Ghost；最特别的是一辆只有三个轮子的 Benz，它造于 1885 年，是参赛车里最老的一辆。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 16,
      "start": 104.861,
      "end": 109.953,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "One of the most handsome cars was a Rolls-Royce Silver Ghost"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 17,
      "start": 110.303,
      "end": 117.087,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Handsome"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "可以形容人，也可以形容车，意思是 elegant and good-looking。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 18,
      "start": 117.436,
      "end": 123.916,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "然后出现最奇特的一辆："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The most unusual car was a Benz which had only three wheels"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 19,
      "start": 124.266,
      "end": 132.738,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Only three wheels"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "很关键：这不是现代赛车，而是一辆非常早、非常特别的老车。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 20,
      "start": 133.088,
      "end": 139.44,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文继续说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Built in 1885, it was the oldest car taking part"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 21,
      "start": 139.79,
      "end": 149.23,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Built in 1885"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "意思是“因为它造于 1885 年”；"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "taking part"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是参加比赛。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 22,
      "start": 149.58,
      "end": 157.94,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第二帧先记中文：漂亮的 Rolls-Royce，奇特的三轮 Benz，1885 年制造，最老但也最有历史感。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 23,
      "start": 158.289,
      "end": 162.409,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第三段，比赛开始，旧车的机械喜剧来了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 24,
      "start": 162.759,
      "end": 173.559,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：一阵响亮的发动机爆响之后，比赛开始；很多车在赛道上抛锚，有些司机修车的时间比开车的时间还多。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 25,
      "start": 173.909,
      "end": 179.049,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "After a great many loud explosions, the race began"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 26,
      "start": 179.399,
      "end": 187.267,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这里"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "explosions"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "不是炸弹，也不是危险事故，而是老发动机砰砰响、回火的声音。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 27,
      "start": 187.617,
      "end": 193.233,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "然后旧车开始出状况："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Many of the cars broke down on the course"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 28,
      "start": 193.582,
      "end": 203.406,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Broke down"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是机器停止工作；"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "course"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "在这里是 race route，比赛路线，不是 school course。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 29,
      "start": 203.756,
      "end": 209.704,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "最有画面感的一句来了："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "some drivers spent more time under their cars than in them"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 30,
      "start": 210.054,
      "end": 217.054,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "本来比赛应该坐在车里开，结果很多时间是在车底下修，这就是这课的老车幽默。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 31,
      "start": 217.404,
      "end": 224.204,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第三帧先记中文：砰砰响后开赛，很多车抛锚，司机钻到车底下修。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 32,
      "start": 224.554,
      "end": 230.314,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第四段，少数车完成比赛，冠军慢得可爱，却一样刺激。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 33,
      "start": 230.663,
      "end": 244.763,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：还是有几辆车完成了比赛；获胜的车达到每小时 40 英里，比任何对手都快；最后它冲下山坡，司机很难把它停住，大家都很开心。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 34,
      "start": 245.113,
      "end": 250.233,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "转折先来："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "A few cars, however, completed the race"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 35,
      "start": 250.583,
      "end": 257.135,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "However"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "把故事从“很多车坏了”转到“还是有几辆跑完了”。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 36,
      "start": 257.485,
      "end": 263.557,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "冠军的速度其实不夸张："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The winning car reached a speed of forty miles an hour"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 37,
      "start": 263.907,
      "end": 270.555,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "但在这场旧车赛里，它已经"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "much faster than any of its rivals"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 38,
      "start": 270.904,
      "end": 279.988,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "结尾还有一点喜剧："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "It sped downhill at the end of the race"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，司机"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "had a lot of trouble trying to stop it"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 39,
      "start": 280.338,
      "end": 284.778,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这不是危险特技，而是旧机器不好控制的好笑紧张感。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 40,
      "start": 285.128,
      "end": 290.04,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "最后作者说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The race gave everyone a great deal of pleasure"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 41,
      "start": 290.39,
      "end": 296.294,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这场比赛"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "was very different from modern car races but no less exciting"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 42,
      "start": 296.644,
      "end": 306.764,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第四帧记住核心：40 mph 不算快，可是旧车会响、会坏、会下坡难停，所以一点也不缺 exciting。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 43,
      "start": 307.113,
      "end": 314.28,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "老师，题目"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Faster than sound!"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是说这辆车真的比声音快吗？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 44,
      "start": 314.63,
      "end": 326.245,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "不是。冠军车只有"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "forty miles an hour"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。题目是玩笑式夸张：声音很大，场面很热闹，所以感觉特别 exciting。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 45,
      "start": 326.595,
      "end": 329.803,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "那这课是不是现代赛车课？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 46,
      "start": 330.153,
      "end": 341.153,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "也不是。现代赛车追求高速、稳定、科技；这课的魅力是 old cars 重新跑起来，漂亮、有历史感、还会出小状况。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 47,
      "start": 341.503,
      "end": 345.461,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Explosions"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "听起来有点危险。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 48,
      "start": 345.811,
      "end": 354.291,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "在这里不要按 bombs 理解。它是 old engines 的 loud pops，老发动机砰砰响，不是火灾、爆炸物或事故。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 49,
      "start": 354.641,
      "end": 358.272,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Broke down"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是人崩溃了吗？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 50,
      "start": 358.622,
      "end": 366.742,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "不是。这里是 cars broke down，车坏了、停了，所以司机才会"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "under their cars"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "修车。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 51,
      "start": 367.092,
      "end": 370.01,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Course"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是课程吗？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 52,
      "start": 370.36,
      "end": 378.52,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这篇里不是。它是 race course，比赛路线。车在 route 上抛锚，不是在 classroom 里上课。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 53,
      "start": 378.87,
      "end": 381.988,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Rivals"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是敌人吗？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 54,
      "start": 382.338,
      "end": 387.978,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "不是 enemies，而是 competitors，比赛里的对手。冠军车比对手快得多。"
