    {
      "i": 58,
      "start": 411.306,
      "end": 438.226,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "先背中文比赛线：每年旧车赛 -> 去年很多车参加 -> 开赛前很兴奋 -> 漂亮的 Rolls-Royce -> 奇特的三轮 Benz -> 1885 年制造 -> 砰砰响后开赛 -> 很多车抛锚 -> 司机钻车底修 -> 少数车完赛 -> 冠军 40 mph -> 下坡难停 -> 大家很开心 -> 和现代赛车不同但同样刺激。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 59,
      "start": 438.576,
      "end": 442.032,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Once a year, a race is held for old cars."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 60,
      "start": 442.382,
      "end": 448.238,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "A lot of cars entered for this race last year and there was a great deal of excitement just before it began."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 61,
      "start": 448.588,
      "end": 452.716,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "One of the most handsome cars was a Rolls-Royce Silver Ghost."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 62,
      "start": 453.066,
      "end": 457.362,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The most unusual car was a Benz which had only three wheels."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 63,
      "start": 457.712,
      "end": 462.128,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Built in 1885, it was the oldest car taking part."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 64,
      "start": 462.478,
      "end": 466.39,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "After a great many loud explosions, the race began."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
