      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "作者用“最”让两辆老车变得好记：一辆漂亮，一辆奇特，一辆最老。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 96,
      "start": 642.996,
      "end": 649.868,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第四块是背景短语："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Built in 1885, it was the oldest car taking part"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 97,
      "start": 650.217,
      "end": 658.433,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Built in 1885"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "相当于“因为它造于 1885 年”，给这辆 Benz 一个历史标签。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 98,
      "start": 658.783,
      "end": 664.231,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第五块是比较级加强："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "much faster than any of its rivals"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 99,
      "start": 664.581,
      "end": 669.285,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Much"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "放在比较级前面，让“快得多”更明显。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 100,
      "start": 669.635,
      "end": 679.486,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第六块是两个有用句型："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "spent more time under their cars than in them"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，和"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "had a lot of trouble trying to stop it"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 101,
      "start": 679.836,
      "end": 687.428,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第一个句型写出修车比开车还多；第二个句型可以记成"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "have trouble doing something"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 102,
      "start": 687.778,
      "end": 694.138,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "最后是结尾金句："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "very different from modern car races but no less exciting"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 103,
      "start": 694.488,
      "end": 700.56,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "No less exciting"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "的意思是：不一样，但一点也不差，同样刺激。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 104,
      "start": 700.91,
      "end": 707.758,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "you_too",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "现在把今天的旧车比赛喜剧放进安全的生活场景："
